 ildren thrive.  We will have activities\, snacks\, and an opportunity to b
 uild community!\n\n📍Location: UCSD Triton Administrative Services Build
 ing (East Wing) first floor Multipurpose Room (E-1321)\n\n⏰Time: 3:00pm 
 - 4:00pm\n\n💡Visit MDM.ucsd.edu for more information regarding the loca
 tion\, transportation\, what to expect\,…\n\nSource: ISEO (iEvents)\n\nh
 ttps://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/mdm-dec2026
