CATEGORIES:ISEO (iEvents)
DESCRIPTION:The Bible has shaped global history\, art\, ethics\, and liter
 ature more than any other text\, yet most people have never read it for th
 emselves. This is an opportunity to read it for yourself over coffee or te
 a. No preaching\, no assumptions\, and no prior background required\, just
  open dialogue.\n\nFAQ's \n\nQ: What is Scripture Reading?\n\nA: Time to r
 ead through the bible\n\nQ: Who is invited?\n\nA: All UCSD students (under
 grads & grads) are welcome to join\, no prior background required. Sign up
  here so we know how much coffee & tea to get and if you need a bible.\n\n
 Q: When & How long is Scripture…\n\nSource: ISEO (iEvents)\n\nhttps://ca
 lendar.ucsd.edu/event/the-big-questions-scripture-reading-dialogue-group
LOCATION:Starbucks @ Price Center
URL:https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/the-big-questions-scripture-reading-di
 alogue-group
